  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Standing Ovation feels like a natural next choice because its stage songs connect directly with my interest in Stages and A Musical Affair.",
    "The apparent Andrea Bocelli collection fits my interest in expressive classical crossover vocals, while Israel Kamakawiwo'ole appeals to the gentler, relaxing side of my listening."
