    "Red Headed Stranger and the Brenda Lee collection do not match what I want today: orchestral warmth or theatrical singing matters more to me than familiar country or older pop songs.",
    "Motown: The Musical connects with my interest in stage music, but its particular repertoire is less appealing to me right now. Hope gives me too little evidence of a musical connection to choose it."
