    "My earlier country and older-pop listening seems to have been treated as a stronger guide to today's choices than it really is.",
    "A connection to musicals or a sentimental album title is not enough on its own; the songs, vocal style, and accompaniment determine whether I want to listen."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest relaxing classical selection suggests that calm mood and gentle listening deserve more weight alongside my interest in powerful stage vocals.",
    "I choose selectively when the musical connection is clear. Titles such as Songs From The Heart, The Perfect Gift, and CLASSICAL GAS suggest possibilities, but without knowing the performer or songs I would hesitate."
  ],
